OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Heaton set for beautiful
OL,4,Asouth Shropshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Housemartins frontman Paul
OL,7,FHeaton is set to perform in beautiful
OL,8,Fsouth Shropshire next year.
OL,10,FHeaton will be joined by Scottish
OL,11,Fsinger-songwriter Rianne Downey on 17
OL,12,FJuly, when he plays as part of the
OL,13,Fannual summer concert series in Ludlow.
OL,15,FThe Live at Ludlow Castle shows will
OL,16,Falso feature McFly, Becky Hill and UB40
OL,17,Fft Ali Campbell, with more acts due to
OL,18,Fbe announced.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
