OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Heaton set for beautiful
OL,4,Asouth Shropshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe concerts began in 2023, with 50,000
OL,7,Fpeople visiting this year over two
OL,8,Fweekends, to see the likes of Snow
OL,9,FPatrol, Paul Weller, The Human League,
OL,10,FTom Grennan, The Streets, Rick Astley,
OL,11,FRichard Ashcroft and Scissor Sisters.
